{
  "nodes": {
    "start": {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Forward partnership multiplies money by time. Reverse partnership asks you to undo that multiplication.\n\nIf the profit ratio is known, it is telling you the ratio of capital × time.\n\nYour job is to peel off the factor you already know.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "teach_1"
        }
      ]
    },
    "teach_1": {
      "id": "teach_1",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "A and B earn profit in the ratio 3 : 2. A stayed 6 months; B stayed 8 months.\n\nCapital ratio = (profit/time):\nA : B = 3/6 : 2/8 = 1/2 : 1/4 = 2 : 1.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "teach_1_step"
        }
      ]
    },
    "teach_1_step": {
      "id": "teach_1_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "You are undoing capital × time.\n\nIf profit ∝ capital×time, then capital ∝ profit ÷ time.\n\nDivide each profit-part by that partner's time, then simplify.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_1"
        }
      ]
    },
    "q_1": {
      "id": "q_1",
      "type": "CHOICE",
      "content": {
        "text": "A : B profit = 5 : 4. A stayed 10 months and B stayed 8 months. What is their capital ratio?",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
