    "teach_7": {
      "id": "teach_7",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "A profit ratio can identify how long a known capital stayed.\n\nA invests ₹11,000 for 8 months. B invests ₹12,000 for t months. Profit ratio A:B = 2:3.\n88,000 : 12,000t = 2 : 3.\nSo t = 11 months.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
