      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Capstone reverse problem: a capital change can hide the starting amount.\n\nA begins with x for 4 months, then adds ₹2,000 for 8 months.\nB begins with ₹7,000 for 4 months, then adds ₹1,000 for 8 months.\nIf profit A:B = 1:1, set their stage totals equal and solve x.",
