        "text": "You can now work backward from profit instead of only forward from investment.\n\nProfit ratio gives capital × time. Divide out known time to find capital; divide out known capital to find time.\n\nA joining month is just 12 minus the months actually invested.\n\nNext, some partnerships will take a manager's cut or another special portion before the normal sharing begins.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": []
    }
